<view class="page-no-tab" style="{{displayStyle}}">
  <view class="card">
    <video
      wx:if="{{news.type === 'video' && news.videoUrl}}"
      class="news-video"
      src="{{news.videoUrl}}"
      poster="{{news.cover}}"
      controls
      show-center-play-btn
      object-fit="cover"
    />
    <image
      wx:else
      class="news-hero-img"
      src="{{news.cover}}"
      mode="aspectFill"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="news-meta">{{news.channel}} · {{news.typeLabel}} · {{news.time}}</text>
    <text class="news-lead">{{news.summary}}</text>
    <view class="news-body">
      <text wx:if="{{news.contentBody}}" class="news-para" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">{{news.contentBody}}</text>
      <block wx:else>
        <text class="news-para">餐后血糖升高，往往不是"突然坏了"，而是进餐结构、进食速度和活动量共同作用的结果。</text>
        <text class="news-para">第一步：看主食。米饭、面条等精制主食升糖更快，建议逐步替换为低 GI 主食如燕麦、糙米。</text>
        <text class="news-para">第二步：控速度。细嚼慢咽，每口咀嚼 15-20 次，给大脑足够时间接收饱腹信号。</text>
        <text class="news-para">第三步：餐后动。餐后 30 分钟轻度活动，如散步 10-15 分钟，有助于平稳血糖。</text>
      </block>
    </view>
    <view class="news-ops">
      <view class="news-op {{liked ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="onLike">{{liked ? '已赞' : '点赞'}}</view>
      <view class="news-op {{collected ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="onCollect">{{collected ? '已收藏' : '收藏'}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
